---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Manifesto | Practical Humanism">
	<article class="manifesto-wrapper">
		<header class="manifesto-header reveal">
			<h1>Manifesto</h1>
		</header>
		
		<div class="manifesto-content reveal">
			<blockquote class="lead-quote">
				"Man is a transitional being, he is not final; for in him and high beyond him ascend the radiant degrees which climb to a divine supermanhood." 
				<cite>— Sri Aurobindo</cite>
			</blockquote>

			<div class="text-block">
				<p>
					I stand where the Ageless Wisdom intersects with the exactitudes of modern logic. 
					What I term <strong>Practical Humanism</strong> is a definite, pragmatic Method for the deliberate unfolding of human potential. 
					I recognize that the present human form is not an ultimate completion, but an intermediate stage.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="sigil-anchor">
				<svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
					<path d="M12 2C7.58172 2 4 5.58172 4 10C4 12.8906 5.54098 15.4214 7.8207 16.7735C8.42301 17.1307 8.5 17.8924 8.5 18.5V20C8.5 21.1046 9.39543 22 10.5 22H13.5C14.6046 22 15.5 21.1046 15.5 20V18.5C15.5 17.8924 15.577 17.1307 16.1793 16.7735C18.459 15.4214 20 12.8906 20 10C20 5.58172 16.4183 2 12 2Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
					<circle cx="9" cy="11" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"/>
					<circle cx="15" cy="11" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"/>
					<path d="M12 14L11.5 16H12.5L12 14Z" fill="currentColor"/>
				</svg>
			</div>

			<div class="text-block">
				<p>
					I cast aside nothing of the ancient tools; rather, I adapt them to present necessities. 
					By applying these traditional instruments with a strictly practical, testing attitude, 
					I aim to awaken the dormant centers of the personality.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="text-block closing">
				<p>
					The ultimate aim is to make of my own vehicle a living laboratory of evolution. 
					The Work demands the balanced development of the entire being: 
					the purification of the mind, the direction of the Will, 
					and the conscious realization of the Indwelling Spirit.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<footer class="reveal">
			<hr />
		</footer>
	</article>

	<script>
		const observerOptions = { threshold: 0.1 };
		const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
			entries.forEach(entry => {
				if (entry.isIntersecting) {
					entry.target.classList.add('active');
				}
			});
		}, observerOptions);

		document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));
	</script>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.manifesto-wrapper {
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 6rem 2rem;
	}

	.manifesto-header {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 5rem;
	}

	.manifesto-header h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 10vw, 3.5rem);
		letter-spacing: 0.5em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		font-weight: 300;
		margin: 0;
		margin-right: -0.5em;
		color: var(--text-color);
	}

	.manifesto-content {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3rem;
		align-items: center;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.lead-quote {
		font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: 1.4rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: var(--accent-muted);
		max-width: 600px;
		margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
		border: none;
		padding: 0;
	}

	.lead-quote cite {
		display: block;
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-style: normal;
		letter-spacing: 0.3em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		opacity: 0.6;
	}

	.text-block {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: var(--text-color);
		opacity: 0.9;
		max-width: 100%;
	}

	.text-block strong {
		color: var(--accent-color);
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.sigil-anchor {
		color: var(--accent-color);
		opacity: 0.6;
		margin: 2rem 0;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.closing {
		font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: var(--accent-color);
		border-top: 1px solid var(--line-color);
		padding-top: 3rem;
		margin-top: 1rem;
	}

	footer hr {
		margin-top: 6rem;
		opacity: 0.1;
		border: none;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--text-color);
	}

	/* Reveal Animation */
	.reveal {
		opacity: 0;
		transform: translateY(30px);
		transition: all 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
	}
	.reveal.active {
		opacity: 1;
		transform: translateY(0);
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.manifesto-wrapper {
			padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
		}
		.manifesto-header {
			margin-bottom: 3rem;
		}
		.manifesto-header h1 {
			letter-spacing: 0.3em;
			margin-right: -0.3em;
		}
		.lead-quote {
			font-size: 1.2rem;
		}
		.text-block {
			font-size: 1.1rem;
		}
		.closing {
			font-size: 1.2rem;
		}
	}
</style>
